# Roobytes project map

Native macOS markdown notes (AppKit + RoobytesCore SPM). **Live Preview only** — no Source Mode. No sidebar drawer (`⌘P` Go to File only).

## Layout

- `Sources/Roobytes/` — app UI
  - `EditorViewController.swift` — shell / state (≈469 lines)
  - Extensions: `+Vim`, `+VimMotions`, `+VimEdits`, `+VimCommandLine`, `+WordCompletion`, `+LivePreview`, `+CaretFeedback`
  - Overlays: `FileSwitcherController` (owns `RoobytesSidebarRowView`), `VimHelp`, `RoobytesTips`, command palette
- `MarkdownBridge` — pure markdown ↔ attributed / caret / task / fold / serializer
- `MarkdownBridge.swift` + `+CaretMapping`, `+Folds`, `+Serializer`, `+Sync`, `+Tasks`
- `FirefoxLauncher.swift` — `BrowserLauncher` (default browser; Firefox Private for `gX`); `FirefoxLauncher` typealias kept
- `FileWatcher.swift` — `DispatchSource` file monitor (external-edit reload); never reloads in Insert mode
- `Tests/RoobytesCoreTests` — harness tests (`./test.sh`); prefer helpers here over UI-only changes
- Ship: `./ship.sh patch|minor|major -m "…"` → bump + commit + `/Applications/Roobytes.app` (see **ship-package** rule)

## Adding a Normal-mode chord / binding

0. **Vim ergonomics first** — prefer the canonical vim key / case split when the action matches a known verb; do not invent chords that contradict muscle memory (see **roobytes-vim** → Ergonomics & convention).
1. Wire key (or pending first key) in `EditorViewController+Vim.swift`; handler in `+VimEdits.swift` or `+VimMotions.swift`
2. `VimChordHints` row when it is a pending two-key chord
3. **Required:** update `VimHelp` (`:h` / `:help`) — add the keys to the right section. Never ship a new Normal binding without a `:h` row.
4. Tip in `RoobytesTips` if user-facing
5. RoobytesCoreTests for pure helpers (+ assert `VimHelp.text` mentions the new keys)
6. `./ship.sh patch|minor -m "…"` (see **ship-package**)

## Related rules

- **ship-package** — `./ship.sh` (bump / commit / package / verify)
- **roobytes-vim** — Roobytes-flavored Normal chords (when editing vim files)
- **roobytes-live-preview** — active line, folds, caret mapping, italic round-trip
- **todo-checkbox** — checkbox glyph hard rules in `MarkdownBridge`
